(7586871, 1221113, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fantastic spiral nicely frozen in time. Gave it a 9. For printing and framing, I''d consider a crop to remove the white area at the base of the stairs, much or all of the dark space on the right, and maybe a bit off the left to remove the furthest yellow panel, all adjusted to taste for best placement of the green ball with spiral drops.</td>', 'Fantastic spiral nicely frozen in time. Gave it a 9. For printing and framing, I''d consider a crop to remove the white area at the base of the stairs, much or all of the dark space on the right, and maybe a bit off the left to remove the furthest yellow panel, all adjusted to taste for best placement of the green ball with spiral drops.', '2018-07-30 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7586874, 1221633, 81362, '<td valign="top">The lighting and dark smooth background lend quite a bit of elegance to this image. Well done.</td>', 'The lighting and dark smooth background lend quite a bit of elegance to this image. Well done.', '2018-07-30 00:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7586957, 1221605, 98565, '<td valign="top">that is so nice - if only there wasn''t that distracting flour box in the bg... (at least it should have been a sugar box)</td>', 'that is so nice - if only there wasn''t that distracting flour box in the bg... (at least it should have been a sugar box)', '2018-07-30 05:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587071, 1221599, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, beautiful image.  Perfect perspective, moment of capture, focus, composition, black and white treatment, and so on.  I love the variation of tones in the water, the boy''s expression, the feeling of summer and joy.<br/>If this doesn''t take the Blue.... well, the stars will continue to shine but I''ll be mumbling considerably.</td>', 'Wonderful, beautiful image.  Perfect perspective, moment of capture, focus, composition, black and white treatment, and so on.  I love the variation of tones in the water, the boy''s expression, the feeling of summer and joy.If this doesn''t take the Blue.... well, the stars will continue to shine but I''ll be mumbling considerably.', '2018-07-30 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587072, 1221607, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, with such delicacy of departure and fervent action.  It''s as if she''s churning honey with her wings.  The purple flowers go nicely with the yellow, and the soft background is dreamy.  Utterly pleasing.</td>', 'Lovely, with such delicacy of departure and fervent action.  It''s as if she''s churning honey with her wings.  The purple flowers go nicely with the yellow, and the soft background is dreamy.  Utterly pleasing.', '2018-07-30 12:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587073, 1221555, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine hummingbird image, unusual in aspect, beautifully so, and actually more enchanting largely devoid of brilliance.  The way the tips of the wings blur out is a marvel.  The green and yellow background is terrific, contributing greatly to the overall effect.</td>', 'Fine hummingbird image, unusual in aspect, beautifully so, and actually more enchanting largely devoid of brilliance.  The way the tips of the wings blur out is a marvel.  The green and yellow background is terrific, contributing greatly to the overall effect.', '2018-07-30 13:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
