(7588557, 1221606, 173844, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an uncle to brag about!  I love her expression and effort.  Many entries are not "mid-something," but rather capturing a moment within continuous action.  Your photo hews so much more closely to the requested raison d''etre of the challenge, and I appreciate that.</td>', 'Now that''s an uncle to brag about!  I love her expression and effort.  Many entries are not "mid-something," but rather capturing a moment within continuous action.  Your photo hews so much more closely to the requested raison d''etre of the challenge, and I appreciate that.', '2018-08-02 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588559, 1221666, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mid-leap, great capture.  This has a documentary feel, like a blurred photo of Bigfoot silhouetted at a distance, striding purposefully towards a nearby 7-Eleven.  An unusual moment that only the patient and dedicated nature-lover is likely to see.  And now us... thanks.</td>', 'Mid-leap, great capture.  This has a documentary feel, like a blurred photo of Bigfoot silhouetted at a distance, striding purposefully towards a nearby 7-Eleven.  An unusual moment that only the patient and dedicated nature-lover is likely to see.  And now us... thanks.', '2018-08-02 15:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588560, 1221517, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice mid-action image.  Great focus that reveals so much about this animal.</td>', 'Very nice mid-action image.  Great focus that reveals so much about this animal.', '2018-08-02 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588567, 1221613, 173844, '<td valign="top">Amusing juxtaposition of bird, tree and hatted human.  It''s just this moment of  juxtaposition of the three that is mid-action, as neither a few seconds before nor afterward would suffice.  Such an interesting image.</td>', 'Amusing juxtaposition of bird, tree and hatted human.  It''s just this moment of  juxtaposition of the three that is mid-action, as neither a few seconds before nor afterward would suffice.  Such an interesting image.', '2018-08-02 15:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588572, 1221159, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''m finding this image very pleasing, the composition, the colors, the out of left field oddity if it.  So encouraging in its implicit lesson of the worth of looking around more closely and persistently.</td>', 'I''m finding this image very pleasing, the composition, the colors, the out of left field oddity if it.  So encouraging in its implicit lesson of the worth of looking around more closely and persistently.', '2018-08-02 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
