(7588806, 1221426, 28742, '<td valign="top">The 1 is well deserved. This lacks the quiet sophistication of a blurry black &amp; white image of a glass of milk sitting on an old dining table next to an unrecognizable, but classic hardcover novel. Yes, it certainly has the WOW factor, but WOW is so cliché and overdone. Maybe if you cropped it halfway through the extended wing and flipped it vertically, then it could be considered avant-garde and worthy of something closer to a 4. The colors are vivid and the focus sharp, otherwise I would have given you a two. You played to the aesthetically ignorant masses and you may have won, but you have made the masses even more ignorant in the process, so Bravo and congratulations. :P <br/> <br/>*straight-faced <strike>the whole</strike> most of the time writing that*</td>', 'The 1 is well deserved. This lacks the quiet sophistication of a blurry black & white image of a glass of milk sitting on an old dining table next to an unrecognizable, but classic hardcover novel. Yes, it certainly has the WOW factor, but WOW is so cliché and overdone. Maybe if you cropped it halfway through the extended wing and flipped it vertically, then it could be considered avant-garde and worthy of something closer to a 4. The colors are vivid and the focus sharp, otherwise I would have given you a two. You played to the aesthetically ignorant masses and you may have won, but you have made the masses even more ignorant in the process, so Bravo and congratulations. :P  *straight-faced the whole most of the time writing that*', '2018-08-03 03:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7588807, 1221454, 28742, '<td valign="top">Voter One: "I hate hummingbirds! All Hummingbird shots shall get a 1!"<br/>Voter Three: "Well that''s just mean and vindictive. I hate hummingbirds also but they at least deserve a 3."<br/> <br/>LOL. Congrats, Karen! I wish this counted for DPL, but glad to see you getting some good recognition. :)</td>', 'Voter One: "I hate hummingbirds! All Hummingbird shots shall get a 1!"Voter Three: "Well that''s just mean and vindictive. I hate hummingbirds also but they at least deserve a 3." LOL. Congrats, Karen! I wish this counted for DPL, but glad to see you getting some good recognition. :)', '2018-08-03 03:05:23.000000', NULL, 0),
