(7588848, 1221567, 173844, '<td valign="top">Must have messed up in posting my comment.  This is beautiful.  The simplicity and balance of the three subjects is charming. I love that tiny bit of focus on the trailing scalloped edges of the butterfly and several petals.  The otherwise soft focus is a pillow on which the dream floats away.</td>', 'Must have messed up in posting my comment.  This is beautiful.  The simplicity and balance of the three subjects is charming. I love that tiny bit of focus on the trailing scalloped edges of the butterfly and several petals.  The otherwise soft focus is a pillow on which the dream floats away.', '2018-08-03 09:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7588850, 1221426, 17203, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> The 1 is well deserved....</i></td></tr></table> <br/>ROFLMAO, Art! That 1 vote came from a troll [now banned] that we knew about during voting. The troll''s votes in Colorful Objects were flushed, but 22 votes of 1 in Kitchen Tools and 16 gifts of contempt in this challenge were inexplicably allowed to stand, and that <i>really</i> disgusts me. While those votes might not affect the final order (much), they do leave a stain. <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67343" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">KarenK</a> was robbed of her fourth 7, which would have shown two places higher on her profile her best finish in 5 years. :-(<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-08-03 12:59:40.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: The 1 is well deserved.... ROFLMAO, Art! That 1 vote came from a troll [now banned] that we knew about during voting. The troll''s votes in Colorful Objects were flushed, but 22 votes of 1 in Kitchen Tools and 16 gifts of contempt in this challenge were inexplicably allowed to stand, and that really disgusts me. While those votes might not affect the final order (much), they do leave a stain.  KarenK was robbed of her fourth 7, which would have shown two places higher on her profile her best finish in 5 years. :-(', '2018-08-03 09:30:23.000000', '2018-08-03 13:59:40.000000', 0),
