(7589049, 1221113, 60581, '<td valign="top">Meaning I am not secret now :D to be honest it took me total 5 attempts to get this show. What I did was first I try to spin the ball to make sure I am able to do and keep it close to the hand, next pre-focus the camera to the distance where I am standing, change the camera setting to multiple FPS mode. Next was try and take the shot, total 5 times I did and I got few shots, I will share those here.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought this was yours, recognised the tones! Would love to know how many takes this took. Fantastic job, and look at your new PB score WTG!! </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-08-03 18:11:45.</i></td>', 'Meaning I am not secret now :D to be honest it took me total 5 attempts to get this show. What I did was first I try to spin the ball to make sure I am able to do and keep it close to the hand, next pre-focus the camera to the distance where I am standing, change the camera setting to multiple FPS mode. Next was try and take the shot, total 5 times I did and I got few shots, I will share those here.Originally posted by Neat: I thought this was yours, recognised the tones! Would love to know how many takes this took. Fantastic job, and look at your new PB score WTG!! ', '2018-08-03 19:04:24.000000', '2018-08-03 19:11:45.000000', 0),
